  "bio": "Alastair Cameron is a highly skilled tattoo artist specializing in vivid illustrative, traditional, and black & gray designs at Stingray Body Art in Allston, MA. Alastair’s work stands out for its bold statement, \"I make tattoos that look like tattoos,\" showcasing a dedication to the traditional essence of the craft. His proficiency in these styles is highly regarded, making him a sought-after artist in the Allston community and beyond."
